    "text": "$\\mathrm{PCl}_{5}$ is dissociating $50 \\%$ at $250^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$ at a total pressure of $\\mathrm{P}$ atm. If equilibrium constant is $\\mathrm{K}_{p}$, then which of the following relation is numerically correct -",
